abstract: >-
  A website and static data API on lithium niobate (LiNbO3): crystal structure, optical, acoustic and
  electro-optic properties, fabrication, devices, history and industry. Code is licensed under GPL-3.0.
  Data (compiled property values with per-value provenance, dispersion models and grids, records,
  timelines, glossary and exported datasets under static/api/) is licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
keywords:
  - lithium niobate
  - LiNbO3
  - thin-film lithium niobate
  - material properties
  - electro-optics
  - nonlinear optics
  - piezoelectricity
